              </AlertDialogTitle>
              <AlertDialogDescription className="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                <span>
                  This will automatically declare the #1 ranked classroom from active evaluations for each undeclared
                  division in {currentMonthLabel} {selectedYear}:
